<p style="text-align: left;">At what point <math alttext="left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> do the graphs of the equations in the given system intersect?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"10d60c54-153c-43d2-8ceb-33fde8526842","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 comma 324 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>324</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"51837ed7-d3a2-4d34-b283-a0380f4c2290","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 comma 328 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>328</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"15bc7cd5-d1a5-4333-a841-817b05dbc74e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 14 comma 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"f8af57a1-f3e5-43b2-83e0-230637bacc3a","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 14 comma 788 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>788</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["51837ed7-d3a2-4d34-b283-a0380f4c2290"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is correct. The point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at which the graphs of the given equations intersect is the solution to the system of equations.&nbsp;Subtracting <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="5"><mn>5</mn></math> from both sides of the equation <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x plus 5 equals 14"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math> yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x equals 9"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>. Substituting <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="9"><mn>9</mn></math> for <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> in the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y equals 4 x squared plus 4"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math> yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y equals 4 left parenthesis 9 right parenthesis squared plus 4"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, or <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y equals 328"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>328</mn></math>. Therefore, the graphs of the equations in the given system intersect at the point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 9 comma 328 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>328</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"fc2ec559","external_id":"1b6bf314-ce44-468e-8236-7d3efe7c0c5f","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"ed03db16-3390-4395-855a-6313e7f5abdc","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.B.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables ","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":3,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x plus 5 equals 14\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>14</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 4 x squared plus 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">At what point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> do the graphs of the equations in the given system intersect?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"10d60c54-153c-43d2-8ceb-33fde8526842","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 comma 324 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>324</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"51837ed7-d3a2-4d34-b283-a0380f4c2290","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 9 comma 328 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>328</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"15bc7cd5-d1a5-4333-a841-817b05dbc74e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 14 comma 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><