ice D is correct. It's given that function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> is exponential. Therefore, an equation defining <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> can be written in the form <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> are constants. The table shows that when <math alttext=\"x equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 1\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields <math alttext=\"1 equals a left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript 0\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"1 equals a\"><mrow>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>a</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>. The table also shows that when <math alttext=\"x equals 1\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals one twenty fifth\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth\"><mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the equation <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth equals left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript 1\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth equals b\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>b</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth\"><mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> in the equation <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis b right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis one twenty fifth right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. For this function, <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to <math alttext=\"negative 25\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth\"><mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. For this function, <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to <math alttext=\"negative one twenty fifth\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth\"><mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. For this function, <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to <math alttext=\"25\"><mn>25</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"one twenty fifth\"><mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554988,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"ff8c5844","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1743430554988,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"f9da1b3c-c8a6-40ae-b912-90cb932f1c07","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"14a98dba-b2e3-4ceb-a889-ece793c461a8","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<figure class=\"table\"><table border=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center; height: 22.3958px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 47.0998%; height: 22.3958px; text-align: center;\" scope=\"col\"><math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math></th>\n<th style=\"width: 47.0998%; height